Data provenance
crates/unityrs-core/src/typetree/commonstring.rs: the 112 strings that
UnityPy 1.25.2's blob parser resolves. 108 come from UnityPy's MIT source
(UnityPy/enums/CommonString.py). Four (1161 Hash128, 1169 RenderingLayerMask,
1188 fixed_array, 1200 EntityId) come from the type-tree package that
UnityPy 1.25.2 ships, which derives from AssetRipper's TypeTreeDumps (no
licence file). They are the names of Unity engine types. The generated file
marks the source of each entry.

crates/unityrs-core/src/classid.rs: class id names generated from
UnityPy 1.25.2's MIT UnityPy/enums/ClassIDType.py.

No type-tree package (TPK) file is included in this repository or in any
binary built from it. unityrs-tpk loads one from a path the user supplies.

No game data is included in this repository. Test inputs are synthetic and
built in code.

